load @/code/vibe/site
  find site

note <The dock, one cell of the mesh, a single here and now, the fourth base element. Its shape is the 24-cell, twenty-four sites and twenty-four faces, equal to its own dual. It meets twenty-four neighbors, one across each face. The dock is the tile the whole mesh is built from, and its outward sites are why it cannot stand alone.>

form dock
  link sites, like list, like site
